                + 'toolCalls}), output?, quotaPercent? (the law\'s FIRST trigger), context? '
                + '({level:converge|handover, pct, delivered} — its SECOND, straight out of '
                + 'sessions.contextGuard: a run told to hand over that wrote no note is '
